&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Mechatronics Teams at Agile Robots&lt;/strong&gt; are looking for an &lt;strong&gt;Electronics Test Engineer (m/f/d)&lt;/strong&gt;. Join our team at our Munich R&amp;amp;D site, where you will design, implement and validate the electronic circuits and software we use to test robot prototypes and subassemblies for development and certification. We are seeking a hands-on electrical engineer who works across circuit design, the lab bench and test software.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Test Electronics:&lt;/strong&gt; Design and implement the electronic circuits and software used to test robot prototypes and subassemblies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Test Analysis:&lt;/strong&gt; Evaluate and analyze test results and share the findings with the multidisciplinary engineering team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Root Cause Analysis:&lt;/strong&gt; Investigate production-related quality issues to determine their root cause.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Production Support:&lt;/strong&gt; Support the production team in troubleshooting and resolving test-related issues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Test Procedures:&lt;/strong&gt; Identify and implement improvements to existing test procedures to make them more efficient and reliable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Documentation:&lt;/strong&gt; Create and maintain documentation for test procedures and results.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Essential Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Background:&lt;/strong&gt; Degree in electrical engineering or a related technical field, or an equivalent qualification plus professional experience in electronics testing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Electronic Systems:&lt;/strong&gt; Solid understanding of electronic systems in robots, including PCB design, sensors and actuators, and motor control such as field-oriented control.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lab Work:&lt;/strong&gt; Hands-on electronics lab experience, including soldering, measurement with oscilloscopes, and cable design and manufacturing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Python Automation:&lt;/strong&gt; Professional experience writing Python to analyze test data and automate test benches.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;System Testing:&lt;/strong&gt; Industry experience testing, verifying and analyzing electronic and robotic systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Driving License:&lt;/strong&gt; Valid driving license.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Beneficial Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Test Bench Automation:&lt;/strong&gt; Experience automating robotic systems and test benches, for example with PLCs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Industrial Communication:&lt;/strong&gt; Familiarity with industrial middleware such as OPC UA and fieldbus systems such as EtherCAT.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Embedded Interfaces:&lt;/strong&gt; Experience with Linux environments including Bash, embedded controllers, and interfaces such as CAN or SPI.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;German Language:&lt;/strong&gt; German language proficiency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h3 class=&quot;TranslationField-module__fieldItemName___Q0F_7 TranslationField-module__aboutUsWrapper___WXJpq&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;A dynamic high-tech company, combined with financial soundness and world-class investors.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Join an interdisciplinary, international team with 60+ different nationalities in a collaborative work environment.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Lots of development opportunities as we continue to grow.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Challenging tasks and impactful projects alongside experts that enable professional and personal growth.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Corporate Benefits Program covering health, mobility, and learning for 100€ net per month.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Modern office facilities with a rooftop terrace overlooking Munich, free drinks &amp;amp; fruits, and regular company events contribute to a good working environment&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Agile Robots&lt;/strong&gt; is a leading provider of AI-powered robotics solutions. By combining artificial intelligence and robotics, the company makes industries smarter, more flexible, and more efficient.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Founded in Munich in 2018 by renowned robotics researchers from the German Aerospace Center (DLR), Agile Robots has experienced rapid global growth. Today, more than 3,500 highly skilled robotics and AI enthusiasts are employed worldwide. The company has one of the largest research and development teams in the AI and robotics industry.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Agile Robots has built a unique portfolio; together with the subsidiaries BÄR Automation, Franka Robotics, idealworks, and Krause Automation, the company covers all areas of AI-driven robotics.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Find out more at: &lt;a id=&quot;menur58p&quot; class=&quot;fui-Link ___1q1shib f2hkw1w f3rmtva f1ewtqcl fyind8e f1k6fduh f1w7gpdv fk6fouc fjoy568 figsok6 f1s184ao f1mk8lai fnbmjn9 f1o700av f13mvf36 f1cmlufx f9n3di6 f1ids18y f1tx3yz7 f1deo86v f1eh06m1 f1iescvh fhgqx19 f1olyrje f1p93eir f1nev41a f1h8hb77 f1lqvz6u f10aw75t fsle3fq f17ae5zn&quot; href=&quot;https://www.agile-robots.com/en/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;https://www.agile-robots.com/en/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Celonis is the trusted platform to industrialize Enterprise AI. At our core is the Celonis Context Model — which combines process data, business knowledge, and intelligence into a living digital twin of the enterprise that AI can actually understand, turning AI&#39;s operational blind spots into operational clarity. World&#39;s leading companies trust Celonis and its global ecosystem of partners to make their AI agents, people, systems, and processes work together, achieving transformational outcomes. We believe there&#39;s a massive opportunity to unlock global productivity and sustainability by giving AI the context to understand how every business process really works. Join our mission to make processes work for people, companies, and the planet.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Solutions Architect specializing in containerized solutions, you will play a crucial, pioneering role in this new initiative. Your primary focus will be leading the deployment of these solutions within our customer environments.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Solutions Architects are vital members of our project teams, often serving as the initial technical point of contact for our customers and key technical stakeholders for a successful deployment of Celonis. To ensure our customers achieve value, you will drive the technical setup required to leverage the full range of Celonis features and functionalities, including process mining, execution management, process automation, Action Flow, and task mining.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Given the unique nature of every customer environment, you will be the key liaison for translating the customer&#39;s technical requirements to ensure successful deployment on the clients infrastructure and successful integrations with their source systems. Furthermore, you will lead discussions on user management and authentication, acting as a technical partner to remove any technical barriers to user adoption.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The work you’ll do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;On Celonis side you are the key technical stakeholder for a successful technical delivery and onboarding of Celonis for enterprise clients.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead technical discussions to analyze customer architecture, recommend optimal solutions, and facilitate deployment, managing expectations amidst technical constraints.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Remove technical obstacles to maximize Celonis user adoption, clarifying technical risks and necessary tradeoffs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Promote reusability by choosing between dedicated customer solutions and broader platform enhancements in collaboration with Celonis product development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish real-time data integrations between customer systems and Celonis via APIs and internal tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Guide customers on authentication, user/group management, and provisioning best practices. Thus, removing all technical barriers to drive user adoption of Celonis.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The qualifications you need:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience of 5+ years, with at least 3 years in deploying and managing containerized applications on Kubernetes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced knowledge with at least one specific Kubernetes distribution (Amazon EKS, Azure AKS, RedHat OpenShift, etc.).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Eligibility for UK Security Check (SC) clearance is required; existing clearance is a strong advantage.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Very good understanding of best practices in deploying, scaling, and maintaining highly available, secure and resilient containerized applications on Kubernetes, ensuring efficient resource utilization and operational stability.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience implementing infrastructure as code (IaC, e.g. with Terraform) is required; Helm or Kustomize experience is strongly preferred. Fluency with additional tools such as ArgoCD, Jenkins, GitHub Actions, Ansible, etc., is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with at least one of the major cloud platforms (AWS, Azure, GCP) would be a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in industry with experience to work on Python, SQL, data pipelines &amp;amp; ETL processes for large volumes of data is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledgeable about security and compliance topics for enterprise applications.Solid experience with project management, outstanding customer-centric &amp;amp; proven experience working with customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A solution-oriented professional that enjoys deep technical discussions as much as transferring your technical knowledge into understandable terms to a broader audience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
