&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Delivery leadership: agile methods, technical team guidance, solution review, programme governance.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Business: business cases, value tracking, and the ability to translate technical choices into economic impact for executives.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
